   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### What your waste could be worth\nMaterial value minus lift fees. Prices and fees are placeholders until your contract is entered.\n\n**Real** = recorded by the system · **Estimated** = calculated with placeholder prices or factors · **Simulated** = not from physical hardware or a real operator"
   },
